  "title": {
   "en": "Zettai Maken no Sousen Duelist ~Ansatsu Kizoku ga Dorei Reijou wo Ikusei Shitara, Majutsu-goroshi no Kyuukyoku ma Kenshi ni Sodatte Shimattanda ga~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "絶対魔剣の双戦舞曲 ～暗殺貴族が奴隷令嬢を育成したら､魔術殺しの究極魔剣士に育ってしまったんだが～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Duelist with The Absolute Anti-magic Swords"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the era of grand magic, where magic reigns supreme, a young nobleman named Jin, who possesses a unique power, is also known in the underworld as the \"Assassin Noble of Magic Killers.\" One day, during the execution of a mission, Jin encounters a mysterious \"slave lady\" named Lynette. Afterward, Jin infiltrates an elite girls' academy with her and ends up teaching his secret sword techniques to the noble young ladies as the only male teacher in the academy!",
   "ja": "魔術全盛の大魔法時代。青年貴族ジンは異端の｢魔剣術｣により、裏世界で「魔術殺しの暗殺貴族」として名を馳せていた。ある日、ジンは依頼の遂行中に謎めいた「奴隷令嬢」リネットを拾い、成り行きから家に迎えることに。その後、彼女と名門女学院に潜入したジンは、唯一の男性教師として令嬢らに己の秘剣術を教えることになり!?魔術のみが正義の世界、影の英雄は理外の魔剣で、落伍者の少女らを絶対強者の頂きに導く！"
  },
